<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Beyond Kashmir, 2019</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Introduzione&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT color=black size=4&gt;BEYOND KASHMIR&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Introduzione&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;IMG alt=http://bsmclan.altervista.org/be.jpg src="http://bsmclan.altervista.org/be.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Introduzione&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Introduction&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="La tensione tra India e Pakistan non sembra diminuire.&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;The tension between India and Pakistan does not seem to diminish.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Oltre ai test missilistici di questo inizio anno da parte di Nuova Delhi&amp;#10;"&gt;In addition to New Delhi missile tests of this beginning of the year&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="si registrano scontri a fuoco lungo la frontiera tra i due Stati&amp;#10;"&gt;there are fire fights along the border between the two States&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="(entrambi potenze nucleari) che corre nella regione contesa del Kashmir.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;(both nuclear powers) running in the disputed region of Kashmir.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Il Ministro degli Esteri pakistano ha fatto sapere in una conferenza stampa&amp;#10;"&gt;The Pakistani Foreign Minister announced at a press conference &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="che truppe indiane hanno aperto il fuoco oltre confine uccidendo un bambino&amp;#10;"&gt;that Indian troops opened fire across the border, killing a child &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="di 8 anni nel villaggio di Jijot Bahadar, nella regione di Khuriatta controllata&amp;#10;"&gt;8 years old in the village of Jijot Bahadar, in the controlled Khuriatta region &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="dal governo di Islamabad.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;from the government of Islamabad.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Fonti cinesi riportano che lo scambio di colpi è stato&amp;#10;"&gt;Chinese sources report that the exchange of shots was &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="piuttosto esteso venendo ad interessare diversi settori del&amp;#10;"&gt;rather extensive coming to affect different sectors of the &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="distretto di Baramulla, 117 km a nordovest della città di Srinagar.&amp;#10;"&gt;Baramulla district, 117 km northwest of the city of Srinagar.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Secondo quanto riferito da Nuova Delhi gli scontri a fuoco sarebbero&amp;#10;"&gt;According to reports from New Delhi the firefights would be &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="nati in risposta alla violazione del cessate il fuoco da parte di truppe&amp;#10;"&gt;born in response to the violation of the ceasefire by troops &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="pakistane che hanno bersagliato postazioni militari e villaggi portando&amp;#10;"&gt;Pakistani who have targeted military posts and villages bringing &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="al ferimento di alcuni civili.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;at the wounding of some civilians.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="La situazione sul fronte del Kashmir sembra non essersi raffreddata: giungono notizie che&amp;#10;"&gt;The situation on the Kashmir front seems to have not cooled down: news come &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="la violazione del cessate il fuoco è continuata da entrambe le parti con&amp;#10;"&gt;the violation of the ceasefire continued on both sides with&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="l’uccisone di un soldato pakistano nel settore di Tangdhar;"&gt;the killing of a Pakistani soldier in the Tangdhar sector; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="in risposta elicotteri di&amp;#10;"&gt;in response helicopters of &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Islamabad si sono levati in volo ma secondo quanto riportato dai media indiani non&amp;#10;"&gt;Islamabad took off but according to Indian media reports not &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="avrebbero oltrepassato il confine pur violando gli accordi che prevedono una “no fly zone”&amp;#10;"&gt;they would have crossed the border while violating the agreements that provide for a "no fly zone"&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="in una fascia di 10 km a cavallo della Linea di Controllo.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;in a range of 10 km straddling the Control Line.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Secondo quanto riferiscono le fonti ufficiali del governo pakistano sarebbero l’esercito&amp;#10;"&gt;According to reports from the official sources of the Pakistani government would be the army &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="indiano non avrebbe rispettato il cessate il fuoco nel settore del Kashmir 335 volte quest’anno,&amp;#10;"&gt;Indian would not have respected the ceasefire in the Kashmir sector 335 times this year,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="uccidendo 15 civili e ferendone altri 65. L’India per contrario smentisce e afferma che le sue&amp;#10;"&gt;killing 15 civilians and wounding 65 others. India, on the contrary, denies and affirms that its &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="azioni sono rivolte a combattere i militanti separatisti che sono supportati da Islamabad.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;actions are aimed at fighting separatist militants who are supported by Islamabad.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Le truppe indiane e pakistane si scambiano colpi regolarmente lungo quella frontiera contesa&amp;#10;"&gt;Indian and Pakistani troops regularly exchange strikes along that disputed border&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="sin dalla creazione dei due Stati spesso e volentieri con particolare violenza, come nel 2016&amp;#10;"&gt;since the creation of the two States often and willingly with particular violence, as in 2016 &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="quando colpi di artiglieria e di mortaio hanno colpite un autobus uccidendo 12 civili in&amp;#10;"&gt;when artillery and mortar shells hit a bus killing 12 civilians in &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="territorio pakistano."&gt;Pakistani territory.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="territorio pakistano."&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en id=result_box&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Negli ultimi 71 anni India e Pakistan hanno combattuto 4 guerre di cui 3 nella regione del&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;In the last 71 years, India and Pakistan have fought 4 wars, including 3 in the region of &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Kashmir e si sono adoperate con successo per raggiungere la capacità nucleare: negli arsenali&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;Kashmir and have successfully worked to achieve nuclear capability: in the arsenals &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN title="delle due potenze si stima vi siano circa 250 testate complessivamente, sufficienti per la totale&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;of the two powers, it is estimated that there are about 250 publications in total, sufficient for the total&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="distruzione di entrambi i Paesi.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;destruction of both countries.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="La situazione rispetto al passato risulta molto piu' complicata dalle differenti congiunture internazionali.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;The situation compared to the past is much more complicated by the different international circumstances.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Il Pakistan ora è sempre più lontano dagli Stati Uniti mentre ha ritrovato nella Cina il suo&amp;#10;"&gt;Pakistan is now farther and farther from the United States while it has found its own in China &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="partner privilegiato.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;privileged partner.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Ora Pechino, già fornitrice del know-how nucleare che ha permesso ad&amp;#10;"&gt;Now Beijing, already a supplier of nuclear know-how that has enabled it to &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Islamabad di raggiungere la capacità atomica grazie agli accordi di cooperazione firmati nel 1986,&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;Islamabad to achieve atomic capacity thanks to the cooperation agreements signed in 1986,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="guarda a Islamabad per la propria espansione commerciale e militare: nel quadro della “Belt and&amp;#10;"&gt;looks to Islamabad for its commercial and military expansion: in the framework of the "Belt and &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Road Initative” si sono stretti accordi di mutua collaborazione economica e soprattutto è cominciata&amp;#10;"&gt;Road Initative "there are close agreements of mutual economic cooperation and above all it has begun &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="la penetrazione cinese in quel settore dell’Asia.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;Chinese penetration in that sector of Asia.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Il Pakistan infatti offre porti e infrastrutture nell’Oceano Indiano che è vitale e strategico per&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;Pakistan in fact offers ports and infrastructure in the Indian Ocean that is vital and strategic for &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="la Cina per completare la “collana di perle” che collegherà il Mar Cinese Orientale con il Mar&amp;#10;"&gt;China to complete the "pearl necklace" that will connect the East China Sea with the Sea &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Mediterraneo attraverso lo stretto di Bab el-Mandeb, nella cui area di recente la Cina ha installato&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;Mediterranean through the Bab el-Mandeb strait, in whose area China recently installed&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Mediterraneo attraverso lo stretto di Bab el-Mandeb, nella cui area di recente la Cina ha installato&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="un suo presidio militare.&amp;#10;"&gt;its military garrison.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Ovviamente, di rimando, l’India vede queste espansione cinese e alleanza con il suo rivale storico come&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;Obviously, in return, India sees these Chinese expansion and alliance with its historical rival as &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="fumo negli occhi e ha cominciato a riavvicinarsi a Washington, che come ben sappiamo intende limitare&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;smoke in the eye and began to draw closer to Washington, which we know how to limit &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="l’espansionismo cinese in Asia e verso il Pacifico.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;Chinese expansionism in Asia and the Pacific.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Pertanto queste nuove alleanze, che di fatto hanno ribaltato gli assetti geopolitici classici nell’area,&amp;#10;"&gt;Therefore these new alliances, which in fact have reversed the classical geopolitical structures in the area,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="se da un lato potrebbero mediare la diplomazia tra Nuova Delhi e Islamabad in funzione e fintanto che&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;if on the one hand they could mediate the diplomacy between New Delhi and Islamabad in operation and as long as &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="dureranno gli accordi commerciali tra Usa e Cina, dall’altro potrebbero portare ad un’escalation qualora&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;the trade agreements between the US and China will last, on the other they could lead to an escalation if &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Pakistan e India gettassero i guantoni e decidessero di risolvere la questione della regione contesa dal&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;Pakistan and India threw the glove and decided to solve the question of the region disputed by the&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Kashmir una volta per tutte: se, in caso di intensificazione di quelle che fino ad oggi sono state solo&amp;#10;"&gt;Kashmir once and for all: if, in the case of intensification of those that until now have been alone &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="scaramucce di confine, venissero coinvolti “osservatori” cinesi o americani – questi ultimi non ancora&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;border skirmishes, Chinese or American "observers" were involved - the latter not yet &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN title="presenti nell’area a quanto risulta – è molto probabile che la situazione precipiti coinvolgendo le&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;present in the area as it turns out - it is very likely that the situation precipitates involving the&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="rispettive “terze parti” in qualcosa di più di un semplice scontro di confine.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;respective "third parties" in something more than a simple border fight.&lt;BR&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Osservatori tecnici americani sono già stati invitati a bordo delle ultime unità sommergibili&amp;#10;"&gt;American technical observers have already been invited on board the latest submersible units &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="di fabbricazione russa della Marina Indiana – causando vive proteste di Mosca – quindi non è&amp;#10;"&gt;of Russian manufacture of the Indian Navy - causing live protests of Moscow - so it is not &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="così lontano dalla realtà ipotizzare che Washington possa inviare i propri “consiglieri militari”&amp;#10;"&gt;so far from reality to assume that Washington can send its "military advisers"&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="nel Kashmir anche in considerazione del fatto che la regione non è contesa solo con il Pakistan,&amp;#10;&amp;nbsp;"&gt;in Kashmir also considering the fact that the region is not only disputed with Pakistan,&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;but also with China.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en id=result_box&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Fine delle trattative&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;End of negotiations&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Il primo ministro del Pakistan, Imran Khan, si è scagliato contro la decisione dell’India&amp;#10;"&gt;The Prime Minister of Pakistan, Imran Khan, has lashed out against India's decision &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="di disdire i negoziati tra i due Paesi che avrebbero dovuto tenersi durante l’Assemblea generale&amp;#10;"&gt;to cancel negotiations between the two countries that should have been held during the General Assembly &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="delle Nazioni unite, previste per la settimana entrante."&gt;of the United Nations, scheduled for the coming week. &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Khan, in carica da agosto, ha definito&amp;#10;"&gt;Khan, in charge since August, has defined &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;SPAN title="il dietrofront dell’India “arrogante” e “negativo”.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;the turnaround of India "arrogant" and "negative".&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="il dietrofront dell’India “arrogante” e “negativo”.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;EM&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Concrete nuclear threats have been declared by Pakistan&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="L'america non puo rimanere a guardare&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5&gt;USA&amp;nbsp;can not remain watching&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="Washington preoccupata per l'aggravarsi della situazione e in risposta alle minaccie nucleari da parte del&amp;#10;"&gt;Washington worried about the aggravation of the situation and in response to nuclear threats by the &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="pakistan contro l'india decide di schierare 2 gruppi navali davanti alle sue coste e una massiccia&amp;#10;"&gt;Pakistan against India decides to deploy 2 naval groups in front of its coasts and a massive one &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title='forza aerea nelle basi aeree offerte dal vicino OMAN,il portavoce della casa bianca ha dichiarato: "La situazione&amp;#10;'&gt;air force in the air bases offered by the neighboring OMAN, the white house spokesman said: "The situation &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="tra queste due nazione e' degenerata,entrambe hanno ha disposizione delle armi nucleari non possiamo rimanere&amp;#10;"&gt;between these two nations and degenerate, both have the disposal of nuclear weapons we can not stay &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title='a guardare"&amp;#10;'&gt;watching" &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="E' probabile che l'america voglia eliminare qualsiasi minaccia nucleare ancor prima che venga presa in&amp;#10;"&gt;It is likely that&amp;nbsp;Usa wants to eliminate any nuclear threat even before it is taken in&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;a consideration in this conflict that has been going on for more than 70 years and which seems to have reached the rough edges.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;Scenario by Roby7979&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;COMMAND: MODERN AIR/NAVAL OPERATIONS ITALIA&lt;BR&gt;COMMUNITY UFFICIALE ITALIANA &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="ma anche con la Cina.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;SPAN title="considerazione in questo conflitto che ormai va avanti da piu di 70 anni e che sembra arrivato ai ferri corti."&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Discord: &lt;A href="https://discord.gg/YwYPNB9"&gt;https://discord.gg/YwYPNB9&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR&gt;FaceBook: &lt;A href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/1238053016329890"&gt;https://www.facebook.com/groups/1238053016329890&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Twitter: &lt;A href="https://twitter.com/ModernNaval"&gt;https://twitter.com/ModernNaval&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR&gt;YouTube:&amp;nbsp; &lt;A href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPwRwTuFxnGyprGzth_R_Zg"&gt;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCPwRwTuFxnGyprGzth_R_Zg&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Twitch: &lt;A href="https://www.twitch.tv/roby7979"&gt;https://www.twitch.tv/roby7979&lt;/A&gt;&lt;BR&gt;Steam Group: &lt;A href="https://steamcommunity.com/groups/ITACMANO"&gt;https://steamcommunity.com/groups/ITACMANO&lt;/A&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN role=button aria-hidden=true id=t-served-community-button class="trans-verified-button goog-toolbar-button" style="DISPLAY: none" unselectable="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN class=jfk-button-img unselectable="on"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=en&gt;&lt;SPAN title="territorio pakistano."&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
